<body>
    <h1>Task Module =E2=80=93 Interview Summary</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"54dc9cdb343b"><strong>Source:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"6f0deaaeef19">Interview Summary.doc</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"a4f8e50a61df" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93InterviewSummary-1.E=
xecutiveSummary">1. Executive Summary</h1>
<p local-id=3D"2e859384a294">This document captures Task Module insights de=
rived solely from the Interview Summary, focusing on lifecycle, actions, ra=
tionale capture, layout preferences, and cross-business visibility.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"330e80f184e2" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93InterviewSummary-2.K=
eyThemes&amp;Implications">2. Key Themes &amp; Implications</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"97d2a5b1-451c-43d4-83bd-40a=
a11aac56b" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d846a8e1-2c55-4c41-acc4-06a13736e170">
<td data-local-id=3D"af8e5561-a231-44a3-a8e5-03bf24ddf03b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f1e41d728685">Theme</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9e2efd20-480b-4b28-b340-c2630cba417b" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a18dcfb6e95c">Insight / Requirement</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4cb3e516-1243-41c9-a881-4c2965e6f497" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8b3d1bf1c656">User Need / Pain Point</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3c21824e-4d7b-4ad9-aed8-b84511abb159" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2dad3559332e">Implication for UX</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"40e787f7-91cc-4628-8afc-42f849e823a5">
<td data-local-id=3D"64979e9b-fd94-4bc8-8ce7-3b49f64b0679" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"51154437a763">Task lifecycle &amp; reminders</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"434e4378-0937-43bc-891a-61c6ecb6b592" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"43fa45f015d5">Tasks must be explicitly Completed or Rejected=
; otherwise they keep reappearing as Overdue. Capture the reason when rejec=
ting.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0eb13fdd-f9cb-4992-943b-9a4ed4151df7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"783344eabaa3">Users are nagged by persistent overdue items; =
need a conclusive way to resolve or dismiss with context.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"2284de81-5089-4c01-8c17-0edd7e8330c4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a214a08e635d">Provide clear Complete/Reject actions; require=
 reason on Reject; consider Snooze/Dismiss with reason; display overdue bad=
ges and filters.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"52d68b54-1fca-4a37-b226-7645932bd131">
<td data-local-id=3D"0ea1b986-6163-445c-9740-33b87a3cd73c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"87cb4fa28ae7">Rejection rationale (scenarios)</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3ac870d9-9ebc-4529-95e9-95ec2f61690e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aa157878c447">Include structured scenario questions to under=
stand why a task is rejected.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"675ac8c7-70db-4ff7-b99f-ec17506d6008" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"44eb4477f375">Lack of structured reasons makes it hard to fi=
nd patterns and improve processes.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"ec1bd375-7cf8-4250-86d3-c2b0b68feaa0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d5a3128865e7">Design a guided reason picker with optional no=
tes and analytics tagging.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5484f634-00cf-41e1-a0e8-8e80587e079b">
<td data-local-id=3D"017432ff-bf4b-4d74-9f98-35c2bfe134c7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"15f99c1f9d63">Layout orientation</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c044c4ea-f9f9-411b-bb19-dc292989f1a2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4da47920b3b3">Grid views cause confusion about reading order=
; preference for single-page / linear view.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3d075efd-9f33-44c3-90f0-73b0728e0ef0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2b78384e34a9">Users feel disoriented in multi-panel grids an=
d are unsure of progression.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"178763dc-192b-4d67-9005-d00881b33548" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a914fb83c5e1">Default to linear list or stepper with explici=
t numbering; if a grid is used, add orientation cues and offer a toggle to =
single-page view.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9ea5bf16-daf0-4d9f-bd73-7e25dfdb6231">
<td data-local-id=3D"84a868bc-acb2-4b70-acc9-6a37d0424750" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"41f070d6fc1b">Multi-business area visibility</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"bb370c84-be29-4121-872c-eff2ae668cc4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1d13321abab2">Stakeholders from Motor asked for their screen=
s in a multi-area app.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"77531567-ff41-4a45-afe7-1c1f99b5d2d4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"00c562ac427b">Each business area needs assurance that their =
workflows are represented.</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e007fd3f-1e44-4bda-b2cc-2bf00a3f0da6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3b9477b07619">Provide a business-area switcher and label are=
a-specific screens; include area-specific demos in reviews.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h1 local-id=3D"f492cc1a9a18" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93InterviewSummary-3.A=
ctionableDesignRequirements">3. Actionable Design Requirements</h1>
<p local-id=3D"f8627c35d29a">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; Add prominent Complete and Reject buttons on task cards; open a required=
-reason dialog on Reject.</p>
<p local-id=3D"8d8b8b0b1173">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; Introduce a structured reason taxonomy (scenario picker) with free-text =
notes; feed analytics.</p>
<p local-id=3D"2af186234ba7">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; Use a default linear list with collapsed cards; expand for details and a=
ctions.</p>
<p local-id=3D"3a5bc36ff707">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; Highlight Overdue state clearly; add filters for Overdue and Rejected-wi=
th-reason.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f78c423452e3">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; Provide a business-area selector (e.g., tabs/segmented) and area labels =
on task views.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"b8b1e1b45e23" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93InterviewSummary-4.A=
ssumptions&amp;OutofScope(forthisversion)">4. Assumptions &amp; Out of Scop=
e (for this version)</h1>
<p local-id=3D"9ca75b90c872">This version excludes MOM-derived items such a=
s SLA thresholds, escalation hierarchy, manager/admin dashboards, task crea=
tion by web users, and audit configuration. Those are covered in the Combin=
ed Requirements document.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"1fa5b50c1e00" id=3D"TaskModule=E2=80=93InterviewSummary-5.T=
raceabilitytoInterviewSummary">5. Traceability to Interview Summary</h1>
<p local-id=3D"114d6fa961cb"><strong>Items mapped to Interview Summary exce=
rpts:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"caa3ec82a789">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; Lifecycle &amp; overdue behaviour; need for Complete/Reject with reasons=
.</p>
<p local-id=3D"884c55df6051">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; Scenario questions for rejection rationale.</p>
<p local-id=3D"60900e6f147e">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; Preference for linear over grid view due to reading-order confusion.</p>
<p local-id=3D"729622017adb">=C2=B7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p; Need for visibility across Motor and other business areas.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
------=_Part_0_1609527459.1773040835285--
